  "bodyHash": "9v/7NTG9THo=",
  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/label.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"171\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/progress.png\" width=\"621\" height=\"35\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:375px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/dark_button_mini.png\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:375px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/bedrock_button_mini.png\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:60px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button_mini.png\"> </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/showcase.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2274\" height=\"749\"></p><hr><blockquote style=\"padding-left:20px;font-style:italic;color:#666\">\n<p>厌倦了Minecraft那千篇一律的基础界面？受够了每次走近附魔台，看到的却是和工作台一样的灰色菜单？想要为你的游戏增添一抹色彩吗？</p>\n<p>隆重介绍“多彩容器”！这是一款旨在让每个Minecraft彩色交互方块的菜单界面都与其本身相匹配的容器GUI替换模组。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\"><strong>- Chris XENO</strong></p>\n</blockquote><h2 style=\"line-height:normal\">现在，我为大家带来完全<strong>重</strong>制、<strong>重</strong>新贴图、<strong>重</strong>新构想的版本——<strong><span style=\"color:#d32927\">R</span><span style=\"color:#e66826\">e</span><span style=\"color:#ec9222\">c</span><span style=\"color:#eab718\">o</span><span style=\"color:#cbd541\">l</span><span style=\"color:#86e441\">o</span><span style=\"color:#7bd6c8\">u</span><span style=\"color:#419be5\">r</span><span style=\"color:#3777e0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#8665e0\">u</span><span style=\"color:#c76ee4\">l </span>Containers</strong>！它支持新版本，拥有全新纹理，带来更深的沉浸感！</h2><p style=\"line-height:normal\">所有GUI的改动灵感均来源于其关联的方块。修复原版Minecraft纹理，更改HUD，甚至包含原版动画GUI，还有<strong>更多更多</strong>内容！</p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/changes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p><p><strong>已更改的纹理图示：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/graphic.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2988\" height=\"5328\"></p>\n</div><p><strong>已更改的纹理列表：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>铁砧&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>附魔台&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>酿造台</li>\n<li>织布机</li>\n<li>制图台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>切石机&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>砂轮</li>\n<li>锻造台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>合成器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>投掷器、发射器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>熔炉、高炉、烟熏炉&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>运输船 <em>(1.21.2+)</em></li>\n<li>运输矿车</li>\n<li>鹦鹉螺壳和僵尸鹦鹉螺壳</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>物品栏</li>\n<li>配方书</li>\n<li>书</li>\n<li>信标</li>\n<li>HUD</li>\n<li>经验条&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>一些小型UI更改和修复</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#009c9c\">“原版+”</span>功能 </strong>(更多信息请阅读“安装指南”)<strong>：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>带职业的村民GUI&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>末影箱&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>马、骷髅马、僵尸马</li>\n<li>骆驼、骡、驴、羊驼</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>OptiFine/OptiGUI 功能：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>包含所有类型和职业组合的村民GUI <em>(OptiGUI 独占)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(Animatica 独占)</em></li>\n<li>末影箱</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>圣诞箱子</li>\n<li>带变种的铜箱子 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>木桶 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>彩色潜影盒</li>\n<li>马、骷髅马、僵尸马</li>\n<li>骆驼、骡、驴（带箱子和不带箱子 - <em>OptiGUI 独占</em>）</li>\n<li>羊驼（带地毯颜色）</li>\n<li>轻微损坏的铁砧、严重损坏的铁砧 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>成书 <em>(OptiGUI+Animatica 独占)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>讲台上的书 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模组支持：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Accessories</li>\n<li>Armor Chroma</li>\n<li>Axiom</li>\n<li>Backslot <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>Charm of Undying <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>Better Enchanting</li>\n<li>Cloth Config</li>\n<li>Detail Armor Bar</li>\n<li>ItemSwapper</li>\n<li>Language Reload</li>\n<li>Mod Menu</li>\n<li>Recursive Resources</li>\n<li>Sawmill</li>\n<li>What Are They Up To</li>\n<li>Horseman</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/installation.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></h4><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">如需获得完整体验，需要 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine！</h3><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:303px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optigui.png\" height=\"60\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:303px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optifine.png\" height=\"60\"> </a>&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div><h3>如果你不想使用 OptiGUI，或者你只使用了 OptiFine 模组，你可以在语言设置中激活内置的 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">“原版+”</span> 模式</h3><p>如何激活：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/vanilla_version.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1390\" height=\"340\"></p>\n<p>如需其他语言支持，请使用主文件下方 <span style=\"color:#f16131\">附加文件</span> 标签页中的独立 VANILLA+ 包</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/curseforge_additional_files.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"150\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/q&amp;a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"103\"></p><p><strong>问答：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><strong>问：我可以在哪里咨询任何问题（不在此列表中的）？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong> 发表评论或加入&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Recolourful Discord 服务器</a>并在那里提问！</p>\n<p><strong>已知问题列表：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><strong>使用 OptiFine 时：&nbsp;</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>村民职业不生效</li>\n<li>木桶显示箱子GUI纹理</li>\n<li>运输船显示最后访问的类箱子容器GUI纹理</li>\n<li>部分类马实体不受支持</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果你只使用 OptiFine，建议使用 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">“原版+”</span> 模式</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>使用 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">“原版+”</span> 模式时：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>在 1.21.9+ 版本中，重命名后潜影盒不显示彩色GUI</li>\n<li>在某些版本中，潜影盒的槽位高亮显示异常/不显示</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>问：箱子/潜影盒/村民职业GUI不生效！</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong> 检查你是否安装了 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine，或者已将语言更改为&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#009c9c\">“原版+”</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：你能为 X 模组添加支持吗？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong> 简短回答：理论上可以。请在评论中留下你的建议，或在 Discord 中提交！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：我可以在整合包中使用 Recolourful Containers 吗？/ 我可以修改 Recolourful Containers 吗？/ 我可以对 Recolourful Containers 做 X 操作吗？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong> 请查看描述底部的使用条款</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：我想支持你！我该怎么做？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong> 关于这个…</p>\n</div><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/support.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1501\" height=\"160\"></a></p><h3>如果你不想要服务器但仍想支持我，<strong>请与你的朋友分享这个资源包，或在 YouTube、TikTok、Instagram 等任何平台展示它！</strong>只需留下此页面的链接，我对此深表感谢！</h3><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>别忘了点赞和关注以获取未来更新！</strong></h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/curseforge.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"54\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/credits.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252",
